---
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section class="py-8 md:py-16 bg-[#3F789E] md:pt-0 md:pb-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:legal-section">
  <Container>
    <div class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-4 md:h-[658px] md:mt-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:card-container">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#EBEBEB] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-row items-stretch overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:card-1">
        <div class="w-24 md:w-36 shrink-0 bg-[#FCF6F5] flex items-center justify-center p-4" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-box-1">
          <span class="text-[#C53527] text-6xl md:text-7xl font-serif leading-none select-none" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-1">§</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-2" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:content-box-1">
          <h3 class="text-[#151B2B] text-lg md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:title-1">Wenn Menschen zu Schaden kommen, wird es ernst</h3>
          <p class="text-[#333333] text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:text-1">Hat eine Pflichtverletzung den Schaden mitverursacht, können Ermittlungen wegen fahrlässiger Körperverletzung (§ 229 StGB) oder fahrlässiger Tötung (§ 222 StGB) folgen. Möglich sind Geld- oder Freiheitsstrafen. Verantwortung und Ursache müssen jedoch nachgewiesen werden.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#EBEBEB] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-row items-stretch overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:card-2">
        <div class="w-24 md:w-36 shrink-0 bg-[#F6F8FB] flex items-center justify-center p-4" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-box-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 text-[#162032]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-2">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line>
            <line x1="8" y1="17" x2="12" y2="17"></line>
            <circle cx="15.5" cy="16.5" r="3.5" fill="#F6F8FB"></circle>
            <line x1="18" y1="19" x2="21" y2="22" stroke-width="2.5"></line>
            <path d="M14.5 16.5l1 1 2-2" stroke="#4CAF50" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-2" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:content-box-2">
          <h3 class="text-[#151B2B] text-lg md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:title-2">Nach einem Brand zählt der Nachweis</h3>
          <p class="text-[#333333] text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:text-2">Dann wird geprüft: Waren die Melder vorhanden, funktionsfähig und <span class="font-semibold text-black" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:oxm4gy">kontrolliert?</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#EBEBEB] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-row items-stretch overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:card-3">
        <div class="w-24 md:w-36 shrink-0 bg-[#F6F8FB] flex items-center justify-center p-4 relative" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-box-3">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-12 h-12 md:w-[60px] md:h-[60px] text-[#162032] mt-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-3-user">
            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
          </svg>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 text-[#4A67A1] absolute top-2 right-4 md:right-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F6F8FB" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-3-bubble">
            <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
            <path d="M8 10h.01"></path>
            <path d="M12 10h.01"></path>
            <path d="M16 10h.01"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-2" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:content-box-3">
          <h3 class="text-[#151B2B] text-lg md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:title-3">„Mein Mieter kümmert sich.“ Aber können Sie es beweisen?</h3>
          <p class="text-[#333333] text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:text-3"><span class="font-semibold text-black" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:oxm4gz">Der Eigentümer</span> muss die vorgeschriebenen Melder einbauen.<br class="hidden md:block" /> Wer sie kontrolliert, sollte klar geregelt und <span class="font-semibold text-black" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:oxm4h0">dokumentiert sein.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#EBEBEB] rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-row items-stretch overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:card-4">
        <div class="w-24 md:w-36 shrink-0 bg-[#F6F8FB] flex items-center justify-center p-4" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-box-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-12 h-12 md:w-16 md:h-16 text-[#162032]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:icon-4">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-2" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:content-box-4">
          <h3 class="text-[#151B2B] text-lg md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:title-4">Auch die Versicherung prüft genau</h3>
          <p class="text-[#333333] text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:text-4">Der Versicherungsschutz entfällt nicht automatisch. Je nach Vertrag und Verschulden kann die Leistung bei grober Fahrlässigkeit jedoch <span class="font-semibold text-black" data-ps="src/components/home/LegalConsequences.astro:oxm4h1">gekürzt werden</span> (§ 28, 81 VVG).</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
